msgctxt "error"
msgid "An unknown error occurred"
msgstr "Ralat tidak diketahui telah berlaku"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Authentication denied"
msgstr "Pengesahan dinafikan"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Device disconnected"
msgstr "Peranti telah terputus sambungan"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Enter a valid IPv4 or IPv6 address"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat IPv4 atau IPv6 yang sah"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Incorrect 2FA code."
msgstr "Kod 2FA tidak betul."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Incorrect credentials."
msgstr "Bukti kelayakan tidak betul."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Invalid username."
msgstr "Nama pengguna tidak sah."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Looks like your system clock is out of sync.\n"
"This may cause issues when connecting to VPN.\n"
"Update your system time and try to connect again."
msgstr ""
"Jam sistem anda nampaknya tidak segerak.\n"
"Ini mungkin menyebabkan masalah semasa menyambung ke VPN.\n"
"Kemas kini masa sistem anda dan cuba sambung semula."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Our servers are not reachable. Please check your internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan kami tidak dapat dihubungi. Sila semak sambungan internet anda."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Proton VPN could not connect to the VPN and blocked access to Internet to protect your IP.\n"
"\n"
"Click \"Cancel Connection\" to restore your Internet connection. If the issue persists please try to sign out and in."
msgstr ""
"Proton VPN tidak dapat menyambung ke VPN dan telah menyekat akses internet untuk melindungi IP anda.\n"
"\n"
"Klik \"Batal Sambungan\" untuk mengembalikan sambungan internet anda. Jika masalah berterusan, sila cuba log keluar dan log masuk semula."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Proton services could not be reached.\n"
"Please try again."
msgstr ""
"Perkhidmatan Proton tidak dapat dihubungi.\n"
"Sila cuba lagi."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Session limit reached"
msgstr "Had sesi telah dicapai"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Something went wrong. Please try submitting your report at:\n"
msgstr "Sesuatu ralat telah berlaku. Sila cuba hantar laporan anda di:\n"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "There is not enough space left on your device."
msgstr "Ruang pada peranti anda tidak mencukupi."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat masa"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Tunnel setup failed"
msgstr "Persediaan terowong gagal"

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication failed. Security key 2FA is not enabled for your "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Pengesahan dua faktor gagal. Kunci keselamatan 2FA tidak didayakan untuk "
"akaun anda."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed: Incorrect PIN"
msgstr "Pengesahan dua faktor gagal: PIN tidak betul"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed: No security key detected"
msgstr "Pengesahan dua faktor gagal: Tiada kunci keselamatan dikesan"

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication failed: The security key you used is not linked to"
" your Proton Account."
msgstr ""
"Pengesahan dua faktor gagal: Kunci keselamatan yang digunakan tidak "
"dipautkan dengan Akaun Proton anda."

