msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Access preferred connections from system tray. Enter country or server "
"codes, separated by commas, to quickly connect (e.g.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."
msgstr ""
"Akses sambungan pilihan daripada tray sistem. Masukkan kod negara atau "
"pelayan, dipisahkan dengan koma, untuk sambung dengan pantas (cth.: NL#42, "
"JP, US, IT#01)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Active port is {new_port}"
msgstr "Port aktif ialah {new_port}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Allow selected apps to connect without VPN protection."
msgstr "Benarkan apl terpilih untuk menyambung tanpa perlindungan VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Automatically disconnect from the internet if VPN connection is lost."
msgstr ""
"Putuskan sambungan internet secara automatik jika sambungan VPN terputus."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been disabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Akses Beta telah dilumpuhkan.\n"
"Mula semula apl untuk perubahan berkuat kuasa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been enabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Akses Beta telah didayakan.\n"
"Mula semula apl untuk perubahan berkuat kuasa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Bypass firewalls to connect to P2P servers and devices on your local "
"network. "
msgstr ""
"Langkau tembok api untuk bersambung ke pelayan P2P dan peranti pada "
"rangkaian setempat anda. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Captures a specific issue you're facing when using Proton VPN to get help from our customer support team.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This file is a recording of all your internet activity during the capture session."
msgstr ""
"Merakam masalah khusus yang anda hadapi semasa menggunakan Proton VPN untuk mendapatkan bantuan daripada pasukan sokongan pelanggan kami.\n"
"\n"
"Amaran: Fail ini ialah rakaman semua aktiviti internet anda semasa sesi rakaman."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Connect to Proton VPN using your own domain name servers (DNS)."
msgstr ""
"Sambung ke Proton VPN menggunakan pelayan nama domain (DNS) anda sendiri."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to a Tor server to access hidden services and onion sites using any "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Sambung ke pelayan Tor untuk mengakses perkhidmatan tersembunyi dan laman "
"onion menggunakan mana-mana pelayar."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."
msgstr ""
"Sambung ke pelayan destinasi anda melalui pelayan VPN kedua yang mempunyai "
"keselamatan maksimum. Lebih perlahan, tetapi lebih peribadi."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "Disalin"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Crash reports help us fix bugs, detect firewalls, and avoid VPN blocks.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Laporan ranap membantu kami membaiki pepijat, mengesan tembok api, dan mengelakkan sekatan VPN.\n"
"\n"
"Statistik ini tidak mengandungi alamat IP anda dan tidak boleh digunakan untuk mengenal pasti anda. Kami tidak akan berkongsi statistik ini dengan pihak ketiga."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Customize your connection by deciding which apps are protected by VPN."
msgstr ""
"Sesuaikan sambungan anda dengan menentukan apl yang dilindungi oleh VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Disables randomization of the local addresses mapping. This can slightly "
"reduce connection security, but should allow direct connections for online "
"gaming and similar purposes."
msgstr ""
"Melumpuhkan pengrawakan pemetaan alamat setempat. Ini boleh mengurangkan "
"keselamatan sambungan sedikit, tetapi sepatutnya membolehkan sambungan terus"
" untuk permainan dalam talian dan tujuan yang serupa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Disabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Melumpuhkan akses beta..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Each code can only be used once"
msgstr "Setiap kod hanya boleh digunakan sekali"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Enabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Mendayakan akses beta..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Get early access and help us test new versions of Proton VPN."
msgstr "Dapatkan akses awal dan bantu kami menguji versi baharu Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "If your security key has a button or a gold disc, tap it now."
msgstr ""
"Jika kunci keselamatan anda mempunyai butang atau cakera emas, ketik "
"sekarang."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Increase your connection speed by up to 400% with performance enhancing "
"technologies."
msgstr ""
"Tingkatkan kelajuan sambungan anda sehingga 400% dengan teknologi penambah "
"prestasi."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Insert the U2F or FIDO key linked to your Proton Account. "
msgstr ""
"Sisipkan kunci U2F atau FIDO yang dipautkan dengan Akaun Proton anda. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to disable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Akses Beta tidak dapat dilumpuhkan.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to enable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Akses Beta tidak dapat didayakan.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "Suis pemutus hanya boleh ditukar apabila sambungan VPN diputuskan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch is blocking any outgoing connections."
msgstr "Suis pemutus menyekat semua sambungan keluar."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Kill switch selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Pemilihan suis pemutus dilumpuhkan semasa VPN aktif. Putuskan sambungan "
"untuk membuat perubahan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Loading app..."
msgstr "Memuatkan apl..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Multiple security keys were found. Tap one to select it."
msgstr "Beberapa kunci keselamatan ditemui. Ketik satu untuk memilihnya."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only allow internet access when connected to Proton VPN. Advanced kill "
"switch will remain active even when you restart your device."
msgstr ""
"Akses internet hanya dibenarkan apabila disambungkan ke Proton VPN. Suis "
"pemutus termaju akan kekal aktif walaupun anda memulakan semula peranti "
"anda."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only selected apps connect with VPN protection. All other traffic is "
"unprotected."
msgstr ""
"Hanya apl terpilih bersambung dengan perlindungan VPN. Semua trafik lain "
"tidak dilindungi."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Permanent Kill Switch is blocking any outgoing connections and preventing your IP to be exposed.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to disable Kill Switch?"
msgstr ""
"Suis pemutus kekal menyekat semua sambungan keluar dan menghalang IP anda daripada didedahkan.\n"
"\n"
"Adakah anda mahu melumpuhkan suis pemutus?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Please establish a new VPN connection for changes to take effect."
msgstr "Sila wujudkan sambungan VPN baharu supaya perubahan berkuat kuasa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protect yourself from ads, malware, and trackers on websites and apps."
msgstr ""
"Lindungi diri anda daripada iklan, perisian hasad dan penjejak pada tapak "
"web dan apl."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protects your IP address by disconnecting you from the internet if you lose "
"your VPN connection. {learn_more}"
msgstr ""
"Melindungi alamat IP anda dengan memutuskan sambungan internet anda jika "
"sambungan VPN anda terputus. {learn_more}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protocol can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "Protokol hanya boleh diubah apabila VPN terputus sambungan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protocol selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Pemilihan protokol dilumpuhkan semasa VPN aktif. Putuskan sambungan untuk "
"membuat perubahan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Mengeluarkan aplikasi akan membatalkan sambungan VPN semasa.\n"
"\n"
"Adakah anda ingin teruskan?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will keep the kill switch active, but your current VPN connection will be terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Mengeluarkan aplikasi akan mengekalkan suis pemutus aktif, tetapi sambungan VPN semasa akan ditamatkan.\n"
"\n"
"Adakah anda ingin teruskan?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Reporting your issue..."
msgstr "Melaporkan masalah anda..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing in..."
msgstr "Sedang log masuk..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection and disable the kill switch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Log keluar akan membatalkan sambungan VPN semasa dan melumpuhkan suis pemutus.\n"
"\n"
"Adakah anda ingin teruskan?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Log keluar akan membatalkan sambungan VPN semasa.\n"
"\n"
"Adakah anda ingin teruskan?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will disable the kill switch, potentially exposing your internet traffic. \n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Log keluar akan melumpuhkan suis pemutus dan berpotensi mendedahkan trafik internet anda. \n"
"\n"
"Adakah anda ingin teruskan?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing out..."
msgstr "Sedang log keluar..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Some required components were not detected on your system. The app may not "
"work as expected."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa komponen yang diperlukan tidak dikesan pada sistem anda. Apl "
"mungkin tidak berfungsi seperti yang dijangkakan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Split tunneling enabled. Remember to restart affected apps."
msgstr ""
"Pemisahan terowong telah didayakan. Ingat untuk memulakan semula apl yang "
"terjejas."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan ini memberikan prestasi terbaik untuk BitTorrent dan perkongsian "
"fail."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."
msgstr ""
"Teknologi ini membolehkan Proton VPN menyediakan kelajuan dan keselamatan "
"yang lebih tinggi di negara yang sukar dijangkau."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will automatically set your protocol to WireGuard."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan ini akan menetapkan protokol anda kepada WireGuard secara "
"automatik."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable NetShield."
msgstr "Tindakan ini akan melumpuhkan NetShield."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable custom DNS."
msgstr "Tindakan ini akan melumpuhkan DNS tersuai."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable kill switch."
msgstr "Tindakan ini akan melumpuhkan suis pemutus."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable split tunneling."
msgstr "Tindakan ini akan melumpuhkan pemisahan terowong."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Tunnels IPv6 traffic through the VPN. Can enhance compatibility with IPv6 "
"networks."
msgstr ""
"Menyalurkan trafik IPv6 melalui VPN. Boleh meningkatkan keserasian dengan "
"rangkaian IPv6."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Usage data helps us overcome VPN blocks and improve app performance.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Data penggunaan membantu kami mengatasi sekatan VPN dan meningkatkan prestasi apl.\n"
"\n"
"Statistik ini tidak mengandungi alamat IP anda dan tidak boleh digunakan untuk mengenal pasti anda. Kami tidak akan sekali-kali berkongsi statistik ini dengan pihak ketiga."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "When enabled, the app starts minimized to the tray."
msgstr "Apabila didayakan, apl dimulakan dalam keadaan diminimumkan ke tray."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"You will be connected to a server as soon as Proton VPN app starts. Replace "
"it with a country ISO code (e.g.: US for United States), a server (e.g.: "
"NL#42) or Fastest for quick connection. Default value: Off."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan disambungkan ke pelayan sebaik sahaja apl Proton VPN dimulakan. "
"Gantikannya dengan kod ISO negara (cth.: US untuk Amerika Syarikat), pelayan"
" (cth.: NL#42) atau Fastest untuk sambungan pantas. Nilai lalai: Mati."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your feedback helps us improve Proton VPN."
msgstr "Maklum balas anda membantu kami menambah baik Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your issue has been reported"
msgstr "Masalah anda telah dilaporkan"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your session has expired. Please sign in again."
msgstr "Sesi anda telah luput. Sila log masuk semula."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "{learn_more} about requirements and alternative installation methods."
msgstr "{learn_more} tentang keperluan dan kaedah pemasangan alternatif."

